          "fact": "L3",
          "source": "lem-emg-fixed-smooth-background-harmonic-data",
          "source_section": "Statement",
          "quote": "Then each entry of this first metric jet has the regularity required by the first-order state class: the metric values are $H^{s+1}$ and the prescribed first derivatives are $H^s$.",
